contentMarkdown:
This fully cut, folded, and hand-sewn case offers a classy yet practical design. The leather is slightly velvety on the inside, and has a typical grain on the outside. Despite its thinness, it is very robust.

Its flexibility will allow you to keep it a few years easily.

The folded and hand-sewn strap has a double use: it serves as a loop to hold the pens or cables you will store, but also to keep the case closed.

